+### PoE Port
+
+This table stores PoE port configuration. The interface name
+is used as the key.
+
+```
+{
+  "POE_PORT": {
+    "Ethernet0": {
+      "enabled": "enable",
+      "pwr_limit": "50.0",
+      "priority": "high"
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
